## Distribution

Source distributions keep upstream notices in their respective submodules and
Cargo packages. Binary release archives should include this file together with
the license texts required by the components actually distributed in the
archive. Update `about.hbs` whenever native submodules are added, removed, or
relicensed, and regenerate this file after Cargo dependency changes with:

```console
cargo install --locked cargo-about --version 0.9.1 --features cli
cargo licenses
```
